## Summary

Two closeout improvements: (1) Step 10b auto-syncs templates/commands/*.md → .claude/commands/ so installed skills never lag canonical source. (2) Step 11 now shows the completion banner BEFORE committing with a 10s proceed-unless-cancel countdown.

## Prerequisites

- wai-closeout.md updated (v2.0.140+)

## What Changed

**Step 10b (new):** `\cp templates/commands/*.md .claude/commands/` — runs after autosave cleanup, before commit. Verify with `diff templates/commands/wai.md .claude/commands/wai.md`.

**Step 11:** Banner displays first with countdown: "Committing in 10s… type cancel/stop/abort to abort." Auto-proceeds on timeout. Step 12 is now verification only (no duplicate banner).

## Batch Sequence

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| 1 | Pull latest wai-closeout.md (v2.0.140+) |
| 2 | Verify Step 10b present |
| 3 | Verify Step 11 shows banner before git commands |

## Adoption Notes

No breaking changes. First closeout after adopting will sync any lagging .claude/commands/ files.
